<BaseLayout
  title="Advertising & Funding Disclosure"
  description="How China AI Hub is funded: no ads, no sponsored listings, no affiliate links. Full transparency about our independence."
  type="article"
>
  <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Advertising &amp; Funding Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: 2026-09-27</p>

    <h2>We are ad-free and independent</h2>
    <p>
      China AI Hub (sinoaihub.com and data.sinoaihub.com) is an independent research and
      reference platform. We operate with <strong>no advertising, no sponsored listings, no paid
      placements, and no affiliate links</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2>What this means for our content</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>No vendor payments</strong> — Chinese AI companies (DeepSeek, Alibaba Cloud, ByteDance, Moonshot, MiniMax, Zhipu and others) do not pay us to be listed, ranked, or described in any particular way.</li>
      <li><strong>No sponsored models or benchmarks</strong> — no vendor can buy a position, a score, or a recommendation.</li>
      <li><strong>No affiliate revenue</strong> — links to vendor pricing pages and documentation are plain reference links; we earn nothing from clicks.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How the project is funded</h2>
    <p>
      The project is operated at our own expense (hosting, research time). It has no revenue
      model. If that changes in the future, this page will be updated before any such change
      takes effect.
    </p>

    <h2>Data provenance and labeling</h2>
    <p>
      All facts carry an evidence type: <em>official</em>, <em>vendor-reported</em>,
      <em>independent</em>, <em>academic</em>, <em>community</em>, or <em>China AI Hub
      analysis</em>. Analysis written by us is labeled as analysis and is never presented as an
      official vendor fact. Benchmark scores are always attributed to their reporting source
      and evaluation configuration.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about our funding or independence: Martin.W —
      <a href="mailto:admin@sinoaihub.com">admin@sinoaihub.com</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
